## JavaScript

```js
// The nested language is highlighted by its own parser.
const greeting = "Hello, Carve!";
const numbers = [1, 2, 3];
console.log(greeting, numbers.map(n => n * 2));
```

> ```js
> const quotedCode = true;
> console.log(quotedCode);
> ```

## Opaque blocks

```=html
<strong>*This is raw text*, not Carve.</strong>
```

%%%
*This text* inside a comment does not become bold.
